Logos of fetchify
=================

Distribution names and logos are trademarks of their owners. fetchify
shows them only to identify the system it runs on.

Most logos are converted from the ASCII art of fastfetch
(https://github.com/fastfetch-cli/fastfetch, commit e09925d3), much of
which comes from neofetch (https://github.com/dylanaraps/neofetch). The
conversion changes the color markers, removes trailing spaces and common
indentation and does not change the drawings. Logos marked "fetchify" were
drawn for fetchify, either because none existed in the required size or
because the existing one was too large.

